  "human_edit_summary": "Resolved all three attempt-2 round-1 findings in design.md, under explicit owner authorization to unfreeze the artifact. (1) Critical NO-REQ-CONTRADICTION: rewrote ## Constraint Compliance to enumerate every requirements.md constraint with its source, adding the previously missing fixture-secrets/PII row (Security Boundaries bullet 3) plus explicit rows for read-only/no-network, fail-closed, no-new-approval-mechanism, no-dual-version-loader and no-domain-artifact. (2) Major OPEN-QUESTIONS-RESOLVABLE: renamed ## Open Items to ## Open Questions and gave OQ-001..OQ-004 the required Owner / Blocks Implementation / Resolution Path fields. (3) Major DEPLOYMENT-CONCRETE: added a ## Deployment / CI Plan section covering deployment target, feature-flag strategy, CI pipeline changes, migration execution order (N/A - no datastore) and rollback. Additionally added a fixture-hygiene bullet to ## Test Strategy as the enforcement point for the secrets/PII constraint. No literal counted by impl-review-precheck.sh:396-402 was introduced, so legacy_design remains true and the precheck's classification of the document is unchanged.",
